@startuml F0.6-c-protocolo-404
title F0.6-c — Protocolo não encontrado (404)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Verificador" as Verificador
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "ProtocoloController" as Ctrl
participant "VerificarProtocoloUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Verificador -> WebApp: ID inexistente
WebApp -> Ctrl: GET protocolo
Ctrl -> UC: execute(id)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT protocolo
Postgres --> UC: vazio
UC --> Ctrl: not found
Ctrl --> WebApp: 404 Problem Details
WebApp --> Verificador: EmptyState\n(sem zona de upload)

@enduml
